  "description": "Sweet peach watercolor clipart bundle inspired by summer orchards, cottage kitchens, homemade desserts, fresh fruit harvests, and cozy tea-time moments 🍑✨ This collection features juicy peaches, peach branches, peach desserts, refreshing drinks, baked treats, and charming kitchen-inspired illustrations painted in a soft watercolor style with warm pastel colors and elegant feminine details.\n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on demand products\n• Stickers & sublimation\n• Scrapbooking & junk journals\n• Invitations & greeting cards\n• Social media graphics\n• Packaging & branding\n• Summer-themed creative projects\n💖 What’s included:\n– 20 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 20 SVG files\n🍑 Included illustrations: whole peach and peach half, bowl of peaches, peach tree branch, potted peach tree, peach jam jar, peach tart, slice of peach pie, peach cheesecake, peach muffins, peach macarons, peach ice cream cone, peach sorbet, peach lemonade pitcher, peach iced tea, vintage peach teapot, peach tea cup, peach pancakes, peach parfait, peach wreath, breakfast tray with peach jam and croissant.\nThis bundle is perfect for summer-themed designs, cottagecore projects, fruit-inspired branding, stationery, stickers, journals, kitchen decor, and print on demand merchandise. The illustrations work beautifully for mugs, tote bags, recipe cards, planners, invitations, packaging, greeting cards, phone cases, wall art, and seasonal creative products.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Sweet peach watercolor clipart bundle inspired by summer orchards, cottage kitchens, homemade desserts, fresh fruit harvests, and cozy tea-time moments 🍑✨ This collection features juicy peaches, peach branches, peach desserts, refreshing drinks, baked treats, and charming kitchen-inspired illustrations painted in a soft watercolor style with warm pastel colors and elegant feminine details.</p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:<br>\n• Print on demand products<br>\n• Stickers &amp; sublimation<br>\n• Scrapbooking &amp; junk journals<br>\n• Invitations &amp; greeting cards<br>\n• Social media graphics<br>\n• Packaging &amp; branding<br>\n• Summer-themed creative projects</p>\n<p>💖 What’s included:<br>\n– 20 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– Transparent background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n– 20 SVG files</p>\n<p>🍑 Included illustrations: whole peach and peach half, bowl of peaches, peach tree branch, potted peach tree, peach jam jar, peach tart, slice of peach pie, peach cheesecake, peach muffins, peach macarons, peach ice cream cone, peach sorbet, peach lemonade pitcher, peach iced tea, vintage peach teapot, peach tea cup, peach pancakes, peach parfait, peach wreath, breakfast tray with peach jam and croissant.</p>\n<p>This bundle is perfect for summer-themed designs, cottagecore projects, fruit-inspired branding, stationery, stickers, journals, kitchen decor, and print on demand merchandise. The illustrations work beautifully for mugs, tote bags, recipe cards, planners, invitations, packaging, greeting cards, phone cases, wall art, and seasonal creative products.</p>",
